#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:289
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MayRoute103Pokemon"
msgid ""
"MAY: Let's see… The POKéMON found\n"
"on ROUTE 103 include…$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：我看看……\n"
"在103号道路能找到的宝可梦有……$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:293
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MayLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"…Oh, I see, my dad gave you\n"
"a POKéMON as a gift.\p"
"Since we're here, let's have a quick\n"
"battle!\p"
"I'll give you a taste of what being\n"
"a TRAINER is like.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"……原来如此，我爸爸\n"
"送了你一只宝可梦啊。\p"
"既然来了，\n"
"我们就来简单地对战一场吧！\p"
"让你体验一下\n"
"当训练家是什么感觉。$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:302
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MayDefeated"
msgid ""
"Wow! That's great!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you're pretty good!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！好厉害！\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你很强嘛！$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:306
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MayTimeToHeadBack"
msgid ""
"MAY: I think I know why my dad has\n"
"an eye out for you now.\p"
"I mean, you just got that POKéMON,\n"
"but it already likes you.\p"
"You might be able to befriend any\n"
"kind of POKéMON easily.\p"
"Well, it's time to head back to\n"
"the LAB.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：我想我明白爸爸\n"
"为什么会关注你了。\p"
"你明明才刚得到那只宝可梦，\n"
"它就已经很喜欢你了。\p"
"说不定不管什么样的宝可梦，\n"
"你都能轻松地和它成为朋友呢。\p"
"好了，我们该回研究所了。$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:316
msgctxt "Route103_Text_BrendanRoute103Pokemon"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Okay, so it's this one and\n"
"that one that live on ROUTE 103…$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：嗯，所以住在103号道路的\n"
"是这只和那只……$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "Route103_Text_BrendanLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"Hey, it's {PLAYER}!\p"
"…Oh, yeah, Dad gave you a POKéMON.\p"
"Since we're here, how about a little\n"
"battle?\p"
"I'll teach you what being a TRAINER's\n"
"about!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，是{PLAYER}啊！\p"
"……哦，对了，\n"
"我爸爸送了你一只宝可梦。\p"
"既然来了，\n"
"我们来小小地对战一场怎么样？\p"
"我来教教你\n"
"当训练家是怎么回事！$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:328
msgctxt "Route103_Text_BrendanDefeated"
msgid "Huh, {PLAYER}, you're not too shabby.$"
msgstr "哦，{PLAYER}，你还挺不错的嘛。$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "Route103_Text_BrendanTimeToHeadBack"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I think I get it.\n"
"I think I know why my dad has his eye\l"
"out for you now.\p"
"Look, your POKéMON already likes you,\n"
"even though you just got it.\p"
"{PLAYER}, I get the feeling that you\n"
"could befriend any POKéMON with ease.\p"
"We should head back to the LAB.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我好像明白了。\n"
"我明白爸爸为什么会关注你了。\p"
"你看，你才刚得到那只宝可梦，\n"
"它就已经很喜欢你了。\p"
"{PLAYER}，我觉得你好像\n"
"能跟任何宝可梦轻松成为朋友。\p"
"我们该回研究所了。$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "Route103_Text_ShouldHaveBroughtPotion"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON is staggeringly tired…\n"
"I should have brought a POTION…$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦累得摇摇晃晃的……\n"
"早知道就带伤药来了……$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "Route103_Text_ShortcutToOldale"
msgid ""
"If you cross the sea from here,\n"
"it'll be a shortcut to OLDALE TOWN.\p"
"Fufufu, that's useful, isn't it?$"
msgstr ""
"从这里渡海过去，\n"
"就是去古辰镇的近路。\p"
"呵呵呵，很方便吧？$"

#: data/maps/Route103/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "Route103_Text_RouteSign"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 103\n"
"{DOWN_ARROW} OLDALE TOWN$"
msgstr ""
"103号道路\n"
"{DOWN_ARROW} 古辰镇$"
